1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,171
Two traps.

2
00:00:01,171 --> 00:00:06,419
Silver carp eats plant plankton; its cousin the bighead eats animal plankton.

3
00:00:06,419 --> 00:00:15,377
And carps kept in ponds mature perfectly well, but they will not spawn, because they need river cues like rising, flowing monsoon water.

4
00:00:15,377 --> 00:00:23,281
Since nineteen fifty six, fish farmers inject hormones to make them spawn; today the drug Ovaprim is used.

